    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In mid-November 2014, the School of Nursing and Midwifery conducted an in house faculty development training workshop on blended learning. Nineteen SONAM faculty members underwent the intensive two-week workshop aimed at arming them with the knowledge and skills needed to conduct blended learning lessons effectively.",
